                                        "entry_id": "5ae72737-70b0-3606-838d-5fd6b8066190",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wheel, propelled by running or falling water, used to power machinery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd04f670-5ed4-48dc-bacb-751898733d44",
                                                "sense_id": "c316632e-cbca-3fc4-8259-26bcbd30ec2d",
                                                "text": "\"Yes, yes, I'll tell you the road directly, it's it's straight on through the wood till you come to the big water-wheel!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cd9598a-7870-44f6-beec-498a18f5072d",
                                                "sense_id": "c316632e-cbca-3fc4-8259-26bcbd30ec2d",
                                                "text": "Turbines have been around for a long time—windmills and water wheels are early examples. The name comes from the Latin turbo, meaning vortex, and thus the defining property of a turbine is that a fluid or gas turns the blades of a rotor, which is attached to a shaft that can perform useful work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb19558e-9036-3ec7-a5c0-4be58a68c33e",
                                        "entry_id": "5ae72737-70b0-3606-838d-5fd6b8066190",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wheel with buckets used to raise water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
